The weave is the flow of magic through the world, felt by a caster as a current that slows, clumps and thickens from place to place. It mends itself with time, so a wound in it has to be held open to last.

Drawing energy out of a person, a heart or an area damages the weave where it is done, and enough of it leaves the whole neighborhood fragile. A fragile weave lets a fracture open onto the void. The tithe asked aboard the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]] left the whole of the strider weak, not just the places where it was paid, and when [[Org/Garrick Textiles/People/Letov Obratz|Letov Obratz]] was wrung out for the first tithe the tear that opened over the dance floor came of it.
